          "Engage the 11% demographic gap (likely additional Asian and mixed-race residents) with active constituent service and cultural visibility; in a heavily Democratic supermajority district, the risk is that smaller demographic groups become invisible within the larger coalition, and their specific economic and social concerns get absorbed into broad majority narratives rather than met with targeted responsiveness.",
