          "Build responsive constituent service infrastructure—this is a constituency with high expectations for responsiveness, specific problem-solving on individual cases, and demonstration that the representative is actively engaged in the community rather than distant or ceremonial.",
          "Monitor and cultivate the Asian, Hispanic, and Black communities within the district; at 11.88% of the population combined, these communities are present and growing, and their economic and social concerns deserve specific legislative attention rather than assumption that they are absorbed into the broader professional-class coalition."
