          "Demonstrate active constituent service and local presence: in an 80-20 district where the margin appears safe, complacency and absenteeism from the district are the primary risks to re-election; an incumbent who maintains visible local presence, responsive constituent service, and visible engagement with local government and employers will retain the margin even if a credible challenger emerges on economic issues."
