          "Engage the Hispanic and Latino community (14.08%) and Black community (11.89%) with specific constituent attention and legislative focus; together they represent over one-quarter of the district and their economic mobility, workplace conditions, and healthcare access are distinct policy concerns, not secondary to white working-class issues.",
