          "Build active constituent engagement infrastructure: the 19.4% renter rate and 42-year median age suggest a diverse rural community beyond the stereotype of inherited Republican voters—renters, younger adults, and working families require active engagement to consolidate as a durable coalition rather than assuming they have nowhere else to go."
