          "Address the renter-homeowner economic divide: with nearly one-third of households renting, housing cost burden, eviction risk, and limited wealth-building opportunity are material concerns that often disappear in homeowner-focused messaging. Distinguishing concrete solutions for renters—rent assistance programs, housing affordability, eviction prevention—from homeowner property tax relief demonstrates that government works for all working-class households.",
