          "Engage the baseline 14% opposition directly on economic grounds, not partisan identity: understand whether it reflects younger or more educated households frustrated by lack of economic opportunity, older homeowners dissatisfied with tax or healthcare outcomes, or specific local governance failures. Address the actual grievance with specificity rather than assuming opposition is ideological.",
