          "Investigate and engage the 8.5% AIAN demographic gap through tribal government and Native American constituent outreach; if this population is currently disengaged or underserved, mobilizing their participation or improving their perception of representation can either strengthen the incumbent or create a challenger opening.",
          "Monitor Democratic messaging on housing, wages, and healthcare in a district where 38% opposition and a young, renter-heavy demographic mean a credible alternative candidate with concrete plans for renters' economic mobility could shift the competitive balance materially."
