          "Consolidate the existing 78% by demonstrating concrete delivery on working-class economic concerns rather than leading with partisan grievance or cultural messaging; the 22% opposition reflects voters evaluating on material outcomes, and the surest way to grow the margin is to show that Republican governance is actually making their lives more economically secure."
