          "Engage the 29.82% white constituency and smaller communities (Hispanic, Asian, AIAN) with specific constituent attention: in a majority-Black district, other communities can become invisible in Democratic messaging focused on the largest demographic group; housing, economic, and service needs for all constituencies require explicit recognition rather than absorption into a generic majority narrative."
